# Scenario needs-user-exec (plan 04-20, D-20, D-22): outcome missing-fixture, exit 13, skip-ok. It
# asks for the operator's EXEC image (`content exec user`), which the gate never passes (--exec),
# so in the gate it ends missing-fixture and the suite reports a visible skip. No image of an
# operator is named or pinned here.
# expect-detail: missing role=exec user
ivss 1
id needs-user-exec
profile intv-2609-ntsc-family-p1
content exec user
content grom zero-grom
content cart diag-cpu-1.ivsc
run-to 4000 cpu-cycles stop halted
assert halted == yes
